    "MUC1 VNTR frameshifts (ADTKD-MUC1): step 52 (VNtyper, opt-in) gave no reading; no standard caller sees them",
    "Autosomal mosaic chromosomal alterations (large gains, losses and copy-neutral LOH in a share of the blood cells): step 51 (MoChA) did not assess this sample"
  ]
}
